**4 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A relatively straightforward Zombie / Dark stage with Kurosawah and Ragin' Gory comprising the Dark enemies and Zyclone, Li'l Zyclone, Zapy and Zuche comprising the main zombie threat. Bring in strong anti-zombie counters such as [[Cadaver BearCat]], [[Housewife Cat|Housewife]] and [[Shigong Cat|Shigong]] on top of a check to Ragin' Gory such as [[Pizza Cat]] or [[Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] and the stage should be simple enough. Bring Holy Blast to unburrow the Li'l Zyclones.

Dogenstein and Mega Baa Baa do almost nothing. Focus on the Zombies and Darks instead. If you're really struggling against the latter, you can slot [[Hitman Cat|Hitman]] to help deal with them.

==Trivia==
*Arbor Aflame may refer to the constant [[wikipedia:Bushfires in Australia|bushfires in Australia]], as [[New Horizon]] has an Australian theme.
*Arbor Aflame may have been designed specifically for [[Narita Kaihime (Uber Rare Cat)|Cleansing Flame Kaihime]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] alongside New Horizon. Cleansing Flame Kaihime targets [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]], the two most prevalent traits in this stage, and gains Sage Slayer, improving her performance against [[Dogenstein]].

